ers</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Chakravarthy</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2011</year>) <article-title>Identification of human triple-negative breast cancer subtypes and preclinical models for selection of targeted therapies</article-title>. <source>J Clin Invest</source><volume>121</volume>: <fpage>2750</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>2767</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21633166</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0068817-Roulin1"><label>9</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Roulin</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Waselle</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Dormond-Meuwly</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Dufour</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Demartines</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2011</year>) <article-title>Targeting renal cell carcinoma with NVP-BEZ235, a dual PI3K/mTOR inhibitor, in combination with sorafenib</article-title>. <source>Mol Cancer</source><volume>10</volume>: <fpage>90</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21791089</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0068817-Blaser1"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Blaser</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Waselle</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Dormond-Meuwly</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Dufour</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Roulin</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2012</year>) <article-title>Antitumor activities of ATP-competitive inhibitors of mTOR in colon cancer cells</article-title>. <source>BMC Cancer</source><volume>12</volume>: <fpage>86</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">22401294</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0068817-Engelman1"><label